    {
      "id": "i1",
      "content": "To begin the process in the Admin Office,"
    },
    {
      "id": "i2",
      "content": "first check if it has started."
    },
    {
      "id": "i3",
      "content": "verify the completeness of the invoices."
    },
    {
      "id": "i4",
      "content": "If they are marked as \"Uncompleted\", they should be returned to the client through postal mail."
    },
    {
      "id": "i5",
      "content": "However, if they are marked as \"Completed\", the process should be continued."
    },
    {
      "id": "i8",
      "content": "Once the invoices are returned to the client, receive the completed ones."
    },
    {
      "id": "i9",
      "content": "Then, mark the relevant box on the invoice entry form"
    },
    {
      "id": "i10",
      "content": "and proceed with checking if the process has been completed."
    },
    {
      "id": "i11",
      "content": "Finally, the process ends."
